<p>NOTE - Net income available for common stockholders for the fourth fiscal quarter of 1997 was $16.2 million, or $0.32 per fully diluted share on 51.7 million shares outstanding. Net income available for common stockholders reflected a one-time reversal of $3.8 million, or $0.07 per fully diluted share, and $1.2 million, or $0.03 per fully diluted share, during the fourth fiscal quarter of 1997 and fiscal 1997, respectively, for previously accreted dividends, resulting from the early redemption of all outstanding preferred stock.</p>
<p>Excluding preferred stock dividend accretion (and adjustment for dividend accretion reversal), net income available for common stockholders was $12.3 million, or $0.25 per fully diluted share during the fourth fiscal quarter of 1997.  This compares with $14.0 million or $0.32 per share in the third fiscal quarter of 1997 and $11.6 million or $0.32 per share in the fourth fiscal quarter of 1996.  </p>
